                <pb facs="0184" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-23"><hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received November 23.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson reports that on the previous night a shell fired from one of the
                    Nictheroy batteries sank the monitor <hi rendition="#italic">Javary</hi> of the
                    insurgent fleet.</p>
            </div>
